==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has been downloaded an incredible 81 MILLION times worldwide! Celebrate with us during a special limited campaign event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between June 12th (11:00am) and June 26th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Fight back against dark forces in "Cover of Darkness"!'''}}<br>
It's a springtime period piece! A flood of Black enemies attacks your cats in this special Cover of Darkness map!

※ After clearing a stage, the next stage can be attempted after some time has passed.<br>
※ Spend a Catamin A during the cooldown period to skip the waiting time and challenge the stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●A relentless attack by Red enemies in the "March of Flames" map!'''}}<br>
Fight off a full-on assault by Red enemies in this limited map! Clear the map once each day to hold back the crimson invaders threatening the Cat Empire!

※ After clearing a stage, the next stage can be attempted after some time has passed.<br>
※ Spend a Catamin A during the cooldown period to skip the waiting time and challenge the stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#34A853|'''even days (6/12, 6/14, 6/16, 6/18, 6/20, 6/22, 6/24, 6/26)'''}} visit {{Color|#34A853|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#46BDC6|'''odd days (6/13, 6/15, 6/17, 6/19, 6/21, 6/23, 6/25)'''}} head to {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmo'''}}s on {{Color|#0000FF|'''6/14, 6/17, 6/20, 6/23, 6/26'''}}!

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

